  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [webpack-dev-server](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server) from `v2.8.2` to `v2.9.7`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>webpack/webpack-dev-server</summary>\n\n#### 2.9.7\n-   [`fd3c176`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/fd3c176d9a84c0e5e6d0ad579910ab0dccd3fe42) 2.9.7\n-   [`ddc1e2c`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/ddc1e2c6d266823fcb9be1a018f8beeb4de4ab1c) fixes #&#8203;1217: edge case with default watchOptions value (#&#8203;1218)\n#### 2.9.6\n-   [`2719590`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/271959000b15a65b0f889cab4bb666e774455040) 2.9.6\n-   [`f967925`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/f96792584a974b8c3174e937582ae41a5750f7d6) fixes #&#8203;1208: watchOptions not passed to chokidar in wds\n#### 2.9.5\n-   [`6c1d3e4`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/6c1d3e4a6cf692e97af44bae56f78bdbe920ee25) 2.9.5\n-   [`6b2d7a0`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/6b2d7a0e023d233a079aa5c75fb82f501a91deeb) fixes #&#8203;1198: bump express for security\n-   [`8a11122`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/8a111227ba341b48e39b936f09a57f7756670065) Update README.md (#&#8203;1194)\n-   [`b10c9eb`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/b10c9eb227035c59788fa94784a633a919fc0a74) Update Examples And Add Hotness (#&#8203;1183)\n#### 2.9.4\n-   [`2e501c8`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/2e501c86fb52ecb9b275e1c21eac9efa402f9974) 2.9.4\n-   [`f87ad34`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/f87ad340d2b819c0a143d4b2245fde58b7bc74bd) Fix https in homepage url (#&#8203;1159)\n-   [`cd01d9e`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/cd01d9e1483dd2e9e6cac7e65e5ba767aeebeb6d) assert ssl certs aren&#x27;t published. fixes #&#8203;1171\n-   [`d2fef58`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/d2fef5803a771a7de7e0f8f218d9c232b7754c05) enhancing server.close with killable\n-   [`0a8f896`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/0a8f8965fba4a46a862497f6e7d1ad9377040a15) fixes #&#8203;860: failure to exit on SIGINT race condition (#&#8203;1157)\n#### 2.9.3\n-   [`3d72858`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/3d7285835bd4934b688ec9669b9712e72567f8cf) 2.9.3\n-   [`a3f7277`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/a3f72779fd958fa2d32825874a427488def60754) fixes #&#8203;1082, #&#8203;1142. bin file bails if local module detected\n-   [`06df2f4`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/06df2f4f9ea3496fc9594f2c6284b76bf6744b2c) Use built version os `sockjs-client` (#&#8203;1148)\n#### 2.9.2\n-   [`32412bb`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/32412bbbabd832ce1f1b6e0c9c8e53bc55875785) 2.9.2\n-   [`1af8f0e`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/1af8f0e508e08b4e8f036311ae6c72b77f77600f) Remove header property validation (#&#8203;1115)\n-   [`c490b24`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/c490b245ad65f315762e03e51710f7f7177b1e7b) allow explicitly setting the protocol from the public option (#&#8203;1117)\n-   [`ee7231b`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/ee7231baf9f41082435832e6df3e57f4dafee013) Changed property descriptor for Array.includes polyfill (#&#8203;1134)\n-   [`5a7f26b`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/5a7f26b54081f5ff5a4bbcdd4e0deb131332095e) updating readme with support, usage, and caveats\n#### 2.9.1\n-   [`97484a9`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/97484a9cebad152e67b2fa5ca40058962295675c) 2.9.1\n-   [`8de5d0a`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/8de5d0a2bf9916439b268b7b7d9ba2d613f35234) fix errant always-on log message regarding &#x27;setup&#x27;\n#### 2.9.0\n-   [`5982806`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/59828060699e64ceb1cce4ef69c6def441064abb) 2.9.0\n-   [`dcb4e3d`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/dcb4e3de81e5d20d8128a59523c1bf53c277548a) feat: deprecate setup in favor of before and after hooks (#&#8203;1108)\n-   [`8bc6daa`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/8bc6daa359e4d251955ea96ae0f0672f012952c9) adding modification option to issue template\n-   [`33bef0d`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/33bef0d5f7cfca7004f08e387af8a84ec705613b) fixes #&#8203;1109: internal-ip update breaks useLocalIp option\n-   [`114e67c`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/114e67cc7f82e09b32839fffcef679b3a288841f) Fixed check for webpack/hot/log when setting HMR log level. (#&#8203;1096)\n-   [`bad7ed5`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/bad7ed570b6799d3517e04153e4517cab190d545) Made error overlay translucent. (#&#8203;1097)\n-   [`3e24ac4`](https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/commit/3e24ac4592b498fd186a24caa0572a2c29853e27) Fix quote style to satisfy ESLint (#&#8203;1098)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
